            <a href="mailto:creator@levythos.com?subject=深空器物师申请" class="btn btn-primary" style="font-size: 1.1rem; padding: 15px 40px; border:none; border-radius: 6px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00e5ff, #008ba3); color:#000;">上传我的设计 (接入终端)</a>
        </section>
    </div>
  </main>
  
